+"""Stage and frame-verify a trusted same-mesh prepared variation privately.
+
+A source item is not equipped in game. Identical geometry is required before
+reusing pose caches; caller-supplied binary and paths must be independently
+reviewed. Failure keeps stages, never replaces an existing runtime.
